# Deliberately minimal.
#
# The whole project is ~6 MB across ~64 files, so EVERYTHING else is tracked
# on purpose. Do not add project folders here. An over-broad ignore file is the
# likeliest reason for content going missing between machines — if a file
# belongs to the project, it belongs in the repo.

# OS cruft
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/
.DS_Store

# Editor / IDE local state
.vscode/
.idea/
*.swp
*~

# Local scratch only
*.log
